        "text": "The coordination play",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "cp-text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "304 people forked this repo. Zero opened a pull request. The autonomous agent has filed 73 self-improvement PRs and built 40+ features solo. The latest repo-actions skill just listed 5 new feature ideas — health endpoint, simulation tagging, cost breakdown, batch runner, Python SDK — sitting there unclaimed. The market turns \"304 forks, 0 PRs\" from a curiosity into a dare. Someone reading this thinks: I could be the first."
      }
