      "props": {
        "text": "Why now",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "wn-text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "The 100-day silence milestone cleared on Oct 15, proving the project can sustain radical non-engagement on marketing. But code contribution is a different kind of silence. 304 forks and zero human PRs against 73 agent-authored ones is the next structural anomaly. Five fresh feature ideas dropped Oct 16 with nobody to build them."
      }
